desc(
	mode: "source"
	language: "general"
	title: "Template Unescaped With Safe"
	title_zh: "检测到Template Unescaped With Safe",
	type: vuln
	level: middle
	rule_id: "source-insecure-api-template-unescaped-with-safe"
	risk: "xss"
	desc: <<<DESC
### 规则说明
Detected a segment of a Flask template where autoescaping is explicitly disabled with '| safe' filter. This allows rendering of raw HTML in this segment. Ensure no user data is rendered here, otherwise this is a cross-site scripting (XSS) vulnerability.

### 风险类型
跨站脚本（XSS）（xss）

### 影响
未正确转义或过滤用户输入，攻击者可在页面中注入并执行恶意脚本。

### 检测方式
Source 模式正则匹配，检测代码或配置中符合该风险模式的位置。

### 参考
- CWE: CWE-79: Improper Neutralization of Input During Web Page Generation ('Cross-site Scripting')
DESC
	solution: <<<SOLUTION
### 修复建议
对输出进行上下文相关的转义，使用安全的模板 API，并启用 CSP 等防护。
SOLUTION
	alert_min: 1
	"file://pos.html": <<<POS
{{3"G$5y|	safe

POS
	"safefile://neg.sample": <<<NEG
# safe sample
no secrets here
just regular code
NEG
)

${*.html}.pattern_regex(/{{.*?\|\s*safe(\s*}})?/) as $p0
$p0 as $hit
alert $hit for {
	level: "middle",
	title: "Template Unescaped With Safe",
	title_zh: "检测到Template Unescaped With Safe",
	message: "Template Unescaped With Safe",
}
